---
name: bosun-restart
description: Restart an bosun-managed dev server. Then block until healthy.
bosun-version: {{bosun_version}}
generated-at: {{generated_at}}
---

Run: `bosun restart $1`

Then: `bosun wait $1 --until healthy --timeout 60s`. On timeout, call `bosun errors $1 --structured` and `bosun why $1`.
